# The name of this CosmosEx on your network.
#
# To use it: change the name on the last line, save, and rename this file
# to hostname.txt. Put the card back and start the CosmosEx: it takes the
# name and renames the file to hostname.done.
#
# The web interface is then at http://<name>.local (here:
# http://cosmosex-studio.local).
#
# A name has letters, digits and "-" only (no spaces, no dots), at most
# 63 characters, and does not start or end with "-". Lines starting with
# "#" are ignored.
#
# Without a hostname.txt the CosmosEx names itself cosmosex-XXXX (the last
# four digits of its serial number).

cosmosex-studio
